{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50496","headline":"一○八 · 王梵志","name":"一○八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"梵志翻着袜，人皆道是错。\n乍可剌你眼，不可隐我脚。\n（《全唐诗续补遗》卷二据《诗话总龟後集》四三引山谷语收此诗。\n文字同，今删去。\n《林间录》卷下引此诗，「乍可」作「宁可」。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50496.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50496","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}